      "value": "Very late reply but you could try to replicate that by using an fx integer that changes what gestures play based on if its 1 or 0. Just add an expression toggle for each. (I use it to toggle between Oculus home and VRC's normal hand animations) [Anim_Fingers is the int used to determine what gets used in this image]",
