  "deletedAt": null,
  "details": "The idea is that an avatar creator can have different gesture control schemes via animator logic depending on the hardware. I mostly suggest this as a way for detecting if a user is an Index, or Oculus controller, that way I can make gestures triggers comfortable for either type of hardware.",
